  body: "# Prescribed-disease codes and changing prescription\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe source uses group
    letters and numbers to identify prescribed diseases and notes that amending legislation may add diseases or
    occupations retrospectively.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nA label or code is not an immutable rule across all
    dates. The 1983 regrouping and the 5 December 2012 change to the pre-1948 restriction have their own roles.
    No disease list or present version has been fully legally reconciled.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 67006,
    PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/693acc2f33c7ace9c4a4202e/dmg-v-11-ch-67.pdf#page=4).\n\
    - [DMG 67008, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/693acc2f33c7ace9c4a4202e/dmg-v-11-ch-67.pdf#page=4).\n\
    - [DMG 67009, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/693acc2f33c7ace9c4a4202e/dmg-v-11-ch-67.pdf#page=4).\n\
    - [DMG 67010, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/693acc2f33c7ace9c4a4202e/dmg-v-11-ch-67.pdf#page=4).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol11-ch67`:
    PDF `3c7414b2ec9ba0ec4073199a063a97072e1bf2c670f1620e241884a39b7e201a`; extracted pages `f6415f436f2f1eea4febaa9f82fbd0ad34a6fc754ce3c59c24fd10311ba0ad12`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:34.130077Z`.\n- `dmg-vol11-ch73`: PDF `3b17129736cf09e79f9df7079d4a83c4c2b74676d356c2c92947ef6cb12839ba`;
    extracted pages `d3ddd9b78f348565850afeafbaecd17ef9937905318211d171770a38ceadd7a3`; acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:34.331056Z`.\n"
